<div class="post">
<h2>January 23, 2007</h2>


<h1 id="a000160">I've Chosen Baldness <em>Before</em> It Could Choose Me</h1>

<p><a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/theroadislife/366745284/" title="Photo Sharing"><img src="http://farm1.static.flickr.com/122/366745284_e0422213e6_m.jpg" width="240" height="180" hspace="10" vspace="10" align="left" alt="Bald" /></a>HOI AN, VIETNAM - We've made it half-way to the North end of Vietnam to the city of Hoi An; famous for the old french architecture.  It's even recently become a world heritage site.   I've got a million photos to upload but it looks like I'll have to wait until we get to Hanoi, the capital.  I'm pretty sure the Internet here in Hoi An is as old as a lot of the buildings.</p>

<p>Oh yes.  In anticipation of eventually going bald of natural causes I've shaved my head.  It's meant to be a sort of trial run for the real world; to test out the shape of my skull, which surprisingly has no terrible bumps or serious discolourations.</p>

<p>The picture above has me covering most of my head.  It's just that I'm so... uhh.. bald now.  I need to get used to it myself before posting it all.   <br />
</p>



